{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0534_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8c01aff1340654ab5e9419e59f90b8f3125d85a02db9e60fba49e3b354568e7c", "ja": "もちろん！\nそれに、百合子には百合子だけの魅力がある。", "zh": "当然！\n而且，百合子有着只属于她自己的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
